Package: b1cc
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gcc, libc6-dev
Description: small clean-room C compiler from the b1nix project
 b1cc compiles a growing subset of C23 to x86_64 and AArch64 code. On Debian it
 builds programs against the system C library: it preprocesses with the system
 headers, writes the object itself and links through the platform's own
 compiler driver.
 .
 This is the compiler b1nix grew up with, packaged as it is. It is not a
 replacement for gcc or clang, and the C it accepts is documented upstream.
